6:["$","main",null,{"className":"min-h-screen","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hero-section","style":{"backgroundImage":"linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6) 0%, rgba(42, 63, 89, 0.8) 100%), url(https://images.luxuryescapes.com/k8poq69wndgino863vk)"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":[["$","$L12",null,{"className":"logo-overlay","href":"/en/","aria-label":"MondoExplora Home","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Mondo"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Explora"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-white","children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"page-header h1","children":"New York to Bangkok"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page-header p","children":"Discover the best way to travel from New York to Bangkok. Compare travel modes and find exclusive hotel deals."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-20","children":["$","$L13",null,{"origin":"new-york","destination":"bangkok","lang":"en","affiliateLink":"https://luxuryescapes.com/search?destinationName=Bangkok&destinationId=le_ff7aa1f9b4062bfee0f99a0453506f1b&adults=2&children=none&pages=2&utm_source=mondoexplora&utm_medium=affiliate&utm_campaign=route&affiliate_id=mondoexplora_001"}]}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"main-content","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hotel-section-header","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Hotel Deals in ","Bangkok"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Find the best accommodation options for your stay in ","Bangkok"]}]]}],["$","$L14",null,{"hotels":[{"vendor_name":"Anantara Riverside Bangkok Resort","offer_country_name":"Thailand","location_heading":"Bangkok","title":"Bangkok Riverfront Luxury with Daily Breakfast, Nightly Free-Flow Cocktails & Cruise Upgrades Available","description":"Discover Bangkok from a new angle with a stay at this five-star stay, perfectly placed on the banks of the Chao Phraya River. With Thailand’s shining capital on the horizon, a complimentary shuttle ferry whisks you to high-end malls, ancient temples and buzzing markets, while 11 acres of tropical gardens offer rare space and quiet in the city. Return to signature Anantara hospitality, steeped in an old-world Siam spirit and 12 extraordinary restaurants and bars. Choose between the international teppanyaki house Benihana, tiki tipples at Trader Vic’s or the waterfront Longtail by the River, the perfect place to kick back and watch the world drift by. Take part in a cultural activity or simply relax poolside or at the world-class spa.","location_subheading":"Thailand","price":449,"original_price":1095,"discount_percentage":59,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006RF00000JAmRpYAL","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/k8poq69wndgino863vk","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/7yvemgv5mrpxbrkpzf8","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/0vlddmtxysscjcpxtn6r","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 2","min_duration":3,"end_date_utc":"2025-08-19 13:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Siam Kempinski Bangkok","offer_country_name":"Thailand","location_heading":"Bangkok","title":"Bangkok City Opulence near Siam Paragon Mall with Daily Breakfast, Resort Credit & Nightly Cocktails","description":"Treat your senses to a decadent urban escape, where regal Thai hospitality meets European flair, perfectly situated in Bangkok's buzzing shopping and entertainment district. Tucked behind the world-famous Siam Paragon shopping centre and just moments from a BTS Skytrain station, this resort-style, five-star oasis redefines luxury with sweeping tropical gardens, free-form saltwater pools and artful interiors at every turn. Culinary moments shine here - savour modern Thai flavours at Sra Bua by Kiin Kiin, relish Mediterranean-inspired grill at ALATi or unwind with cocktails and live music at the glamorous 1897 Lounge. Keep an eye out for rotating gourmet pop-ups that bring global flavours to Bangkok's doorstep. After a day of temple-hopping, street food trails and retail therapy, retreat to your elegant guestroom or suite, or indulge in traditional Thai healing rituals at the luxurious Kempinski The Spa.","location_subheading":"Thailand","price":839,"original_price":1785,"discount_percentage":53,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006RF00000IYXTpYAP","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/blg3whwigo72a7gwtbt","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/v6rmu7r1xvp3ky1vbdv","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/hkdlrgbkjba5fqrkn69f","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 2","min_duration":3,"end_date_utc":"2025-08-08 13:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Sofitel Bangkok Sukhumvit","offer_country_name":"Thailand","location_heading":"Bangkok","title":"Central Bangkok Art-Deco Escape with Belgian Rooftop Bar, Pool & Spa","description":"Placing you in Bangkok’s beating heart, this five-star address blends French chic with Thai vibrance, rising above Sukhumvit Road. From the moment you step into the lobby, adorned with Thai art and grand chandeliers, you can expect the exceptional. Lounge by the sparkling pool with a cocktail in hand, get pampered at Le Spa or kick back in the opulence of your room or suite. Savour Italian fare at Bella Sera, fusion Japanese cuisine at Maison Mizuki and classic French baked delights at Le Macaron. For something more indulgent, head to Bangkok's first Belgian restaurant - Belga Rooftop Bar & Brasserie, perched on the 32nd floor and showcasing glittering skyline views. When it's time to explore, Sukhumvit's shopping, dining and nightlife await.","location_subheading":"Thailand","price":206,"original_price":206,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006RF00000GUQ5XYAX","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/6qi0qnmbn8ghvyvk475u","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/5l1brtq44hy5jguglic4","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/tezxspj7abvd79fqozgjg","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Novotel Bangkok Platinum Pratunam","offer_country_name":"Thailand","location_heading":"Bangkok","title":"Sophisticated High-Rise Bangkok Elegance Above Renowned Mall with Rooftop Infinity Pool & Spa","description":"Enjoy a stylish stay in the heart of Bangkok’s shopping paradise. A world of comfort, style, and convenience awaits at this haven perched in the Bangkok skyline, above the famed Platinum Shopping Mall. With CentralWorld, Siam Paragon, and Big C just a short stroll away, and the BTS Skytrain within easy reach, your Bangkok adventure is at our doorstep. Unwind with breathtaking city views, take a refreshing dip in the infinity pool and sip handcrafted cocktails at the rooftop bar. Indulge in a global culinary journey with flavours from Thailand, Japan, India, and beyond with an international buffet at The Square Restaurant. Venture beyond the hotel to explore the bustling Pratunam Market or savour the flavours of Thailand at the nearby street food stalls. On your return, embrace Let's Relax Spa to recharge your mind, body and soul.","location_subheading":"Thailand","price":123,"original_price":123,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006RF00000Elgv0YAB","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/gtkb1wya6hcq11qj3x9e","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/xufug1sr77o7j0s2j4oc","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/m2rcngw0lqhpwnbclvag","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Novotel Bangkok on Siam Square","offer_country_name":"Thailand","location_heading":"Bangkok","title":"Stylish Bangkok Urban Escape near Siam SkyTrain Station with Onsite Restaurant & Outdoor Pool","description":"Immerse yourself in the contemporary chic spirit of this plush Novotel urban sanctuary, perfectly positioned in the heart of Bangkok's vibrant Siam Square. Take advantage of the hotel's prime location and explore the Thai capital to the fullest with easy access to the Siam SkyTrain station, the world-renowned MBK centre and the high-end Siam Paragon Mall. Indulge in a feast of flavours at The Square as you relish local Thai delights and sip on signature cocktails at the Gourmet Bar after a day of exploration. For some relaxing moments, go for a swim in the sparkling outdoor pool or pamper yourself with restorative facial and body treatments at the Tammachart Day Spa.","location_subheading":"Thailand","price":106,"original_price":106,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006Ii000002IlwCIAS","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/tyw2ibub1giyexk1h2c7","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/dh0kwgnyjiljmt4quvri","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/3p9hkrudojr5p2a6nwgt","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Pullman Bangkok Hotel G","offer_country_name":"Thailand","location_heading":"Bangkok","title":"Pullman Bangkok Luxury with Onsite Spa, Michelin-Rated Restaurant, Rooftop Bar & Pool","description":"Experience five-star Pullman luxury at this stylish retreat high above the Bangkok bustling streets. Savor Michelin-rated dining at Scarlett Wine Bar on the 37th floor, or enjoy cocktails at the rooftop bar 25 Degrees, home to one of Bangkok’s best burger joints. Unwind by the swimming pool or at the onsite spa after a day of exploring vibrant Silom Road, or take a short stroll to top attractions like Patpong Night Market, Lumphini Park and Mahanakhon Skywalk.","location_subheading":"Thailand","price":69,"original_price":69,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006Ii000002IlwhIAC","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/v1rtiwhg7crl6f050xv","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/a4ae6ihk78kpz70zsogl","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/ke01l4sjm2tqg7cs889g","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"}],"lang":"en"}],"$L15"]}],"$L16"]}]
